<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SAYS INSURED BY LLOYD'S.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SAYS INSURED BY LLOYD'S.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanka , Latvia's second largest bank, said on Thursday that it had bought insurance from Lloyds of London insurance facility.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that it had bought a three-year policy covering two risk areas.</p>
<p>The policy involves bankers' blanket bond coverage against robbery, dishonest acts of staff or clients and risks connected to electronic and computer crime.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
